      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS exceeds analyst expectations while revenues lag behind",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹24.07 (up from ₹22.28 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹124.7b (up 3.3% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹17.1b (up 8.0% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 14% (in line with FY 2025). Revenue missed analyst estimates by 4.5%. Earnings per share (EPS) exceeded analyst estimates by 2.4%. Revenue is forecast to grow 9.8% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 5.9% growth forecast for the Beverage industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 13% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 17% per year.",
